      "title": "read me",
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Models.** Krea 2 Turbo, its Qwen3-VL text encoder and the Qwen-Image VAE, under the Comfy-Org file names. Flux or SD 3.5 work too - pick your own files here. **LoRA:** pick your file in the loader below, then Ctrl+B to switch it on, and put its trigger word into *LoRA trigger* (a person) or the prompt template (a style). More LoRAs: chain further loaders."
      ],
      "color": "#2b2b2b",
      "bgcolor": "#1f1f1f"
    },
