      "title": "read me",
      "widgets_values": [
        "**All-in-One Studio.** Open the **Photoshoot Studio** tab in the left sidebar (or click **edit** below) to configure **Person**, **Wardrobe**, **Look**, **Pose** and **Shoot** in one place without extra nodes on the canvas. **Black & white?** Pick a black & white *Look* under *Look → Style*, then switch on *Monochrome* on the right (Ctrl+B). Press **Start shooting** to run. [All controls](https://github.com/ralksta/ComfyUI-Photoshoot/blob/main/docs/nodes.md)"
      ],
      "color": "#2b2b2b",
      "bgcolor": "#1f1f1f"
    },
